			"widgets_values":[
				"Standing position, both hands naturally hanging down, the lower part of the legs is not shown, no display of the lower legs\n一、Background Environment Analysis\n\nThe background presents an indoor space filled with otaku/ACG culture elements, creating a sweet and girly atmosphere. The core of the background is the multi-layer shelving units, densely packed with various anime plush toys and figurines.\n\n• Details of Shelving Units:\n\n◦ On the upper shelf, the plush toys are diverse, including classic anime characters. Some toys feature striking color contrasts, such as white cat-shaped plush toys, black cat toys, and cartoon figures with large yellow eyes, adding visual interest.\n\n◦ On the middle shelf, besides the plush toys, there are framed decorations. The content inside the frames appears to be anime scenes or character posters, further strengthening the ACG theme. The lighting design of the shelving units adopts blue-purple tones, creating a dreamy atmosphere. The light shines on the toys and the background wall, making the entire space warmer and more layered.\n\n◦ Below the left shelving unit, there is a red-and-white cartoon plush toy (similar to a character from the Sanrio family). Next to it are placed electronic devices, such as a keyboard and a monitor, suggesting this is a space that combines daily life and hobbies. On the right side, part of an item with the word \"Cinnamoroll\" printed on it is visible, further pointing out the theme of Sanrio series elements.\n\n二、Analysis of the Character’s Outfit\n1. Top: Pink-and-black paneled V-neck sweater\nFit: Oversize, longer length (suits the \"missing bottom\" look); features lantern sleeves with cinched cuffs, black block paneling on the body, and frayed, torn hems with tassel frays — giving off a casual, tattered vibe.\nPrints: The front displays a black spiderweb + dark graffiti print, paired with drip-textured lines — these are iconic dark elements of subculture.\nColor scheme: The main color is soft pink, contrasted with black accents, which perfectly balances sweetness and edge.\n2. Bottom: Black multi-layered ruffled mini skirt\nStyle: A short-tiered cake skirt with layered ruffled tiers; black lace chain embellishments dangle from the hem, mixing sweet girly vibes with dark details.\nFit compatibility: The short cut is partially covered by the top, enhancing the laid-back \"missing bottom\" vibe.\n3. Accessories: Dark layered choker necklace\nIt’s styled with a layered set: a black heart choker, a beaded chain, and a cross pendant. This piece echoes the sweetness of the pink while amplifying the subculture edge.\n三、Facial Features and Makeup Details\n\n• Facial Features:\n\n◦ The character’s facial makeup is exquisite. The foundation is fair and smooth, presenting a delicate texture. The blush uses light pink, gently swept on both sides of the cheeks, creating a natural blushing effect and enhancing the sweetness of a young girl.\n\n• Eye Expression and Eye Makeup:\n\n◦ The eyes are bright, and one eye winks, looking playful and agile. The eye makeup is mainly in pink tones, echoing the color of the overall outfit. The eyelashes are thick, curled, and wear natural-colored contact lenses, enlarging the pupils while increasing the clarity of the gaze. At the end of the eyes, there is a delicate eyeliner outline, enhancing the clarity of the eye contour.\n\n• Lips and Eyebrows:\n\n◦ The lips are painted with light pink lipstick, with a soft color that matches the overall makeup style. There is a slight brightening treatment on the edge of the lips, making the lips appear plumper and more three-dimensional. The eyebrows are carefully shaped into a natural crescent shape, and the color coordinates with the hair. Light pink eyebrow makeup is used, further strengthening the overall sweet style.\n\n五、Color and Light Analysis\n\n• Overall Color Tone:\n\n◦ The picture uses pink and white as the main colors, with the blue-purple light in the background, forming a soft and dreamy color combination. The blue-purple light, as ambient light, not only highlights the colors of the plush toys but also adds a cool filter to the character’s skin, making the overall color of the picture richer.\n• Lighting Effects:\n\n◦ The light mainly focuses on the character, possibly the effect of indoor fill lights, making the character the visual focus. The light is even, without obvious shadows, highlighting the details and texture of the outfit. The background light plays a role in setting off the atmosphere. The contrast between the blue-purple light and the warm-toned outfit of the character enhances the layering and visual impact of the picture.\n\n六、Details of Legs and Clothing Match\n\n• Leg Presentation:\n\n◦ The character wears white knee-high socks, only expose the thighs. The knee-high socks have simple light pink patterns, consistent with the overall style of the outfit. The thigh lines appear smooth and delicate under the light. The short skirt design of the outfit cleverly highlights the leg lines, while the knee-high socks add a touch of implicit sexiness, forming a subtle balance with the overall sweet style.\n\n七、Lens and Picture Composition\n\n• Lens Angle:\n\n◦ The lens adopts a slightly upward angle from the front, which can fully display the character’s full-body look while highlighting the details and posture of the outfit. This angle also makes the character’s image appear more upright, enhancing the visual effect of the picture.\n\n• Composition Technique:\n\n◦ The character is positioned in the center of the picture,  forming a composition method of \"character subject + rich background.\" 、enriching the content of the picture without overwhelming the main subject, so that the audience’s sight always focuses on the character. The black borders on the top and bottom of the picture (possibly the default setting of the video playback interface) further focus on the main content in the middle.\n"
